\section*{Method 1}
\(2 \mathrm{Ms}, 2 \mathrm{Es}, 2 \mathrm{Ns}: \frac{(\text { total number of letters })!}{2!2!2!}\) 1 mark for dividing the total number of letters by \(2!2!2!\)
